si te nombramos.

1728
01:41:22,164 --> 01:41:24,917
Hola, Lance, soy Megan Twohey,
de <i>The New York Times</i>.

1729
01:41:25,000 --> 01:41:28,337
Tenemos una circular de O'Connor
a The Weinstein Company.

1730
01:41:28,420 --> 01:41:29,755
¿Qué? Mierda.

1731
01:41:29,839 --> 01:41:31,465
